ms.criteria:
Translation:
・The intended outcome is a high quality and precise Portuguese subtitles to the specific videos targeted by this milestone;
・Our process already has built-in quality control (the human translator). This was done to ensure that the subtitles were of high quality, unlike what is achieved using AI alone;
・The objective will be considered achieved if modules 1, 2 and 3 contain the option of accurate Portuguese subtitles, without errors and with good synchronization with the video.

Marketing:
・For the specified reasons in the "Outputs" section, there won't be a report for the marketin

ms.promise:
As stated in the first milestone, the transcription and translation process will be the following for every video that we'll provide Portuguese subtitle:
・An AI will generate the SRT file (transcription and translation done automatically);
・The SRT file will be uploaded to the YouTube studio tool;
・Using the YouTube studio tool, the human translator will review the SRT and adjust it as needed to ensure a high quality subtitle;
・Publish the Portuguese subtitle using the YouTube studio tool, so anyone watching the video can select to use Portuguese subtitle.

